{"aliases":["Emergent Abilities","涌现能力"],"external_ids":{"arxiv":"2206.07682"},"history":[{"agent":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-21T06:09:19.066824+00:00","fields":["id","how","why","kind","name","slug","what","layer","props","status","name_zh","summary","created_at","importance","tracked_at","expanded_at","merged_into","occurred_at","created_by_run"],"intent":"seed: LLM 核心领域","op":"insert","reason":null,"run_id":"r_20261021_ny1mqh"}],"node":{"created_at":"2026-10-21T06:09:19.066824+00:00","created_by_run":"r_20261021_ny1mqh","expanded_at":null,"how":null,"id":"n_01m5eh84ssn8tb6k5b","importance":3,"kind":"concept","layer":"knowledge","merged_into":null,"name":"Emergent Abilities","name_zh":"涌现能力","occurred_at":null,"props":{},"reviewed_at":"2026-10-21T06:09:19.149211+00:00","slug":"emergent-abilities","status":"active","summary":"在小模型上几乎不存在、规模越过阈值后才出现的能力。","tracked_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-21T06:09:19.066824+00:00","updated_by_run":"r_20261021_ny1mqh","what":"某些任务的表现在模型较小时接近随机，超过某个规模后突然显著提升。","why":"如果能力随规模平滑增长，就能从小模型外推，涌现意味着部分能力无法提前预测。后续研究指出这种突变部分源于评测指标的非线性，提醒人们谨慎解读评测曲线。"},"relations":[{"confidence":0.75,"created_at":"2026-10-21T06:09:22.496044+00:00","dir":"in","id":"e_01m5eh8863j2zy7xp1","other_id":"n_01m5eh84sssp6ybtff","other_kind":"concept","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"In-Context Learning","other_name_zh":"上下文学习","other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"in-context-learning","other_summary":"模型仅凭提示中的少量示例就完成新任务、无需更新参数的能力。","rationale":"原论文把少样本提示下多种任务能力的突然出现列为涌现能力的典型例子。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"Emergent Abilities of Large Language Models","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2206.07682"}],"type":"is_a","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null}],"sources":[{"field":null,"published_at":"2022-06-15","publisher":"arXiv","quote":null,"title":"Emergent Abilities of Large Language Models","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2206.07682"}],"topics":[{"id":"n_01m5eh84sra8ycr22y","name":"Pretraining","name_zh":"预训练","slug":"pretraining"}],"updates":[]}